$(x^3+1)^2 = x^6 + 2x^3 + 1$
$(x^n+1)^2 = x^{2n} + 2x^n + 1$
So
$$S_n = \sum_{_n^n} (x^n + 1)^2 = \sum_n (x^{2n} + 2x^n + 1)$$
